{
  "format": "story-pages-v1",
  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-and-the-snowy-zigzags-v4-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "4e19b9b4bd530e96acd0bbb4899a362a34a0fd983eca5c4891138df9d2896b0f",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cc250c342c4a0e94b415d0888db6ef619c9de9b6e2b26a793371874b8f536161",
      "text": "悟空的\n雪地弯弯",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0e5dead60e6be51a478a374bcb79682d40ad5e6dea0c11b65a188c1c0867ee27",
      "text": "玉兔挥挥手。\n“欢迎你，悟空！”\n“欢迎你，铁扇公主！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b1ace177d309aa46709e0701f880e984957fa7986de44aa46f318076e4fa52d6",
      "text": "金箍棒和铁扇子，\n都收进小柜子里。\n穿好雪靴，踩上雪板。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fb663d71afbbdc721a224aeae5c106a9aa242274e1821616dca6327f1dd58a1b",
      "text": "“我的脚变长啦！”\n悟空摇摇晃晃，\n两块雪板滑向两边。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fc3348499ac639ec7cdc74e7433b91432454f5f3c257b33d960a67adef898c8d",
      "text": "水獭教练检查每顶头盔。\n“先在小缓坡上练习哦。”\n大家认真听。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "32cb0a9538e3246001e8a03baf89e520db8bfdd8ae8e6895867d657ea06c05fa",
      "text": "悟空迈得太快啦。\n扑通！坐进软软的雪里。\n尾巴上顶着一个雪球。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7e1085de02724451b95af1a85677c16210d651357c2401752dd8e6da42f409c8",
      "text": "铁扇公主坐进软雪里。\n“皇家雪坐垫！”\n她哈哈大笑。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8141e9be68320a875a5345c52c212dea26d3edb2891678044842942e5d47adbd",
      "text": "她“唰”地停下来。\n再看看前面的弯道——\n那个弯好大呀。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2e801b7dca331a65048284df33dd2d090465b4b668021147494ff73dd1f6fa67",
      "text": "悟空弯弯膝盖。\n“小脚，慢一点！”\n他抬头看向坡下。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c8aacc0b1c37c4864995277463ca630229127ad3094d61814f74f9efce36fd1d",
      "text": "教练用小旗标出宽宽的路。\n玉兔在旁边喊：“慢慢来！”\n悟空认真听。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5a56ecb9d24cf7730d8131d32beca605b55773d2da7c9a6eec6fdc946dced09a",
      "text": "铁扇公主慢慢呼了口气。\n弯弯膝盖，转个小弯，\n雪板绕过了小旗。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d332efe9429176cc6286d3f2c96c8f565390c5a67445c51650eccabf7624c6b4",
      "text": "悟空弯弯膝盖，转个弯。\n“慢慢滑。转个弯。停！”\n他停在小旗旁边。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "481b06a751f8eee006ba57c1261ce782d54b842f1c5fe16487fc2ca3ea4c9e48",
      "text": "他们回头看。\n雪地上，两条弯弯的线\n交叉在一起。\n“像两条丝带！”玉兔喊。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "97e759d6c6e72d3b263de859f1c0eec7e76f08a9dba42c4648942f2e3c892c57",
      "text": "三杯暖暖的热可可，\n一碗小鱼饼干。\n吹一吹，小口喝，小口喝。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8a86ee8f714b9145030a724af6e27386ce83d7d474047bf69b7796fbb31d8bb7",
      "text": "“我的小鱼不会滑雪！”\n“我的小鱼会游泳……\n游进我的肚子里！”\n咔嚓，咔嚓。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "feaf130da86b5dcb294f85767a09eca3fe3a5c34fe2ff4d0b53bb9c8b7890e78",
      "text": "他们画下弯弯的滑雪路线。\n玉兔添上小小的雪花。\n窗外，雪花轻轻飘。\n屋里，可可还暖暖的。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "289f1ec520e4ee3afd619415c1cb27295d9ced81c1cf804b8ba097d89c275be2",
